ZephCore is built on code from other projects. The MIT license above covers
ZephCore's own files. The following keep their own license and notices; each
file keeps its header.

- **MeshCore** (MIT). Copyright (c) 2025 Scott Powell / rippleradios.com.
  Source: https://github.com/meshcore-dev/MeshCore. Its notice applies to the
  files ported from it, listed in `.editorconfig`, and to the board files that
  carry its header.
- **Zephyr RTOS** (Apache-2.0). Per-file notices stay in the Zephyr tree.
  Covers `zephcore/patches/zephyr/*.patch`, which modify Zephyr files and are
  applied to the Zephyr tree fetched by `west update`, and
  `zephcore/patches/zephyr-new/drivers/entropy/fake_entropy_native_sim.c`, which
  replaces a Zephyr file and keeps its Oticon A/S notice. The Apache-2.0 text is
  in [LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt](LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt).
- **Monocypher** (BSD-2-Clause OR CC0-1.0). Copyright (c) 2017-2020 Loup Vaillant.
  `zephcore/lib/monocypher/` (see file headers).
- **Semtech LR20xx driver** (Clear BSD). Copyright Semtech Corporation.
  `zephcore/patches/zephyr-new/drivers/lora/lr20xx/lr20xx_driver/` (see its
  `LICENSE.txt`).
- **Semtech LR1110 firmware images and bootloader code** (Clear BSD). Copyright
  Semtech Corporation. `zephcore/tools/lr1110_updater/lib/` and
  `zephcore/tools/lr1110_updater/src/lr1110_bootloader.{c,h}`. Each
  `*_license.txt` there also contains a BSD-2-Clause notice by Kenneth MacKay
  (2014). Clear BSD grants no patent license.
- **Leaflet** (BSD-2-Clause). Copyright (c) 2010-2023 Vladimir Agafonkin,
  (c) 2010-2011 CloudMade. `custom_builder_web/vendor/leaflet.*`.
- **esptool-js** (Apache-2.0). Copyright 2019 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD.
  `custom_builder_web/vendor/esptool-js.*`.
- **fflate** (MIT). Copyright (c) 2026 Arjun Barrett. `custom_builder_web/vendor/fflate.*`.
- **ZephCore logo** (WTFPL). By [recrof](https://github.com/recrof).
  `img/kite-network-logo-*.svg`.
